Level buildings to reduce zombie spawns and clear your path to victory! Your main resources are gold, steel, and survivors, all crucial for upgrading your train. Gold can be found in crates and buildings like tombs, cabins, supermarkets, and police stations. Steel comes from metal objects such as cars, camper vans, and reinforced structures. Survivors are hidden in safe houses, and their numbers vary with each run, making every playthrough unpredictable and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1787970646\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/338d883a1e845024f013dec1741b2c72.avif?t=1787970646 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a fresh experience with procedurally generated tracks. Choose from one of three unique journeys at the start. Go slow and steady, gather resources, upgrade your train, and prepare for escalating waves of zombies. Defeat the boss and reach the journey’s end to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1787970646\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/cd54ba745d09f1fe5b2c467483cb5744.avif?t=1787970646 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with multiple color schemes! Choose your favorite in the Settings menu. Adjust resolution, rebind keys, and 5120×1440 ultra-wide monitors are supported. One handed play is supported through the Accessibility menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1787970646\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras_big/ca1c23dbcb5c84fbe3f0375cd2a59a2c.avif?t=1787970646 width=1560 height=886 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
